# GitNexus index scope for ti84-transpile.
#
# Keep the hand-written eZ80 engine + tooling; drop generated artifacts and the
# disposable research scaffolding (2,154 one-off probes + 749 phase reports) that
# inflated the graph to ~183K nodes and broke the LadybugDB checkpoint.
#
# .gitignore is already honored by GitNexus (ROM.transpiled.js, logs/,
# state/cross-agent/ are skipped via it), so this file only adds what git still
# tracks. To pull a specific probe back into the index, add a negation, e.g.
#   !TI-84_Plus_CE/probe-phase99d-home-verify.mjs

# --- Disposable research scripts: one-off probes (2,154 files) ---
TI-84_Plus_CE/probe-*.mjs

